# Emissaries of God (abyssea 182): a level 99 Warrior in Port Jeuno with Death and Rebirth completed, the quest accepted
# and five of the six caturae titles (not Raja Regicide; GMs). Joachim with five: no section: his script's 328. The Hall
# of the Gods at Prog 0 and 18:00: nothing (section 2 wants Prog 1). Raja Regicide (a GM): 344, finished: the Abyssite
# of Discernment, Prog 1; 344 again (section 1 has no Prog check; the reply kind: an Event-rank 344 would alternate with
# his own onTrigger), finished: Prog 1 (npcUtil.giveKeyItem of a held key item: nothing, no message). The Hall of the
# Gods at Prog 1: 12:00 and 17:00 nothing; 18:00: 8, finished: completed, Beneath a Blood Red Sky accepted; back to
# accepted at Prog 1 (GMs): 04:00: 8 again; back again: 05:00: nothing. Completed (a GM) with Prog 1 and the six:
# Joachim plays his 328, and the Hall at 20:00 nothing.
lists PortJeuno/Joachim/onTrigger PortJeuno/onEventFinish/344 PortJeuno/onEventFinish/328 HallOfTheGods/onZoneIn/1 HallOfTheGods/onEventFinish/8
