finish                                  # completed; Beneath a Blood Red Sky accepted
quest Abyssea.BeneathABloodRedSky available # a GM
quest Abyssea.EmissariesOfGod available # a GM
quest Abyssea.EmissariesOfGod accepted  # a GM
